abstract: >-
  A hands-on laboratory for two-stage retrieval in RAG systems: hybrid
  BM25 + dense search fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion, cross-encoder
  reranking, multiple chunking strategies, and offline benchmarks reporting
  recall@k, MRR@k, and nDCG@k.
